t speed, and range."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Outlaw","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/382df469a091c33e190ee583b64923e8.png","desc":"Precision kills greatly decrease reload time."},{"name":"Air Trigger","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/21341179175df69bcd71b8c4f2d2ebe6.png","desc":"Increased ammo generation. When airborne, accuracy and reload speed are increased but target acquisition is decreased."},{"name":"Keep Away","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/597cd0f1c5fe1f7681a1c129f8b958dd.png","desc":"Increases reload, range, and accuracy when no targets are in close proximity."},{"name":"Lone Wolf","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/4c244b847778a484726543e5c35935ef.png","desc":"Slightly improves aim assist, aim down sights speed, and airborne effectiveness. Increases these effects when there are no nearby allies."},{"name":"Cooling Baubles","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/295dc04060640b2da62789daa321d113.png","desc":"Collecting an Elemental pickup, collecting an Orb of Power, or destroying a Tangle reduces heat.\n\nElemental pickups include [Solar]Firesprites, [Void]Void Breaches, [Arc]Ionic Traces, [Stasis]Stasis Shards, and [Strand]Strand Tangles."},{"name":"Quickdraw","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6893bb2c7ec7d13cb0d91ec9dd8b6500.png","desc":"This weapon can be drawn unbelievably fast."},{"name":"Delicate Tuning","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/2f13fda9c012f281539af9efd42ee3f4.png","desc":"While at low heat, this weapon has improved range, handling, and accuracy."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Offhand Strike","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/599d73ea677633784655fc4161327c14.png","desc":"Final blows grant additional weapon range, stability, and accuracy when firing from the hip for a short duration."},{"name":"Frenzy","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/23e06f4ced1b3e6476f342978ff5bb37.png","desc":"Being in combat for an extended time increases damage, handling, and reload for this weapon until you are out of combat."},{"name":"Jolting Feedback","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/27270b6f5da035b05fa797c82bb6a10d.png","desc":"Dealing repeated damage with this weapon inflicts Jolt. \n\nWhile amplified, Jolt is applied faster."},{"name":"Desperate Measures","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/25692d31f4963c07c3a82aba508b52b6.png","desc":"Weapon final blows grant bonus damage. Melee and grenade final blows grant a larger damage bonus that can stack."},{"name":"Precision Instrument","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e6a4ebc1a8a73e4c7fcfc21c69000ce2.png","desc":"Dealing sustained damage increases precision damage."},{"name":"Opening Shot","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/276e8ce23910c6ee2a6b88b076a2004c.png","desc":"Improved accuracy and range on the opening shot of attack."},{"name":"Thermal Atomization","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/38c52b8d37f9c7eb6927cfd20a3995d2.png","desc":"While at high heat, this weapon deals increased damage and causes targets to explode when defeated."}]},{"label":"Origin Trait","weight":0.5,"perks":[{"name":"Accelerated Assault","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0fe2a63b375af0d8b17ccee5ad65415b.png","desc":"Dealing sustained damage with this weapon loads a small amount of ammo from reserves, or removes heat, and slightly increases damage."},{"name":"Air-Cooled Core","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ef9bcdbfc8d8308d73464e129377eb67.png","desc":"Sprinting increases vent or reload speed for a short time. While at low heat or full magazine, gain increased handling and movement speed when aiming down sights."}]}],"modes":{"all":{"rolls":[[0,12,21,30],[4,12,21,30],[0,12,20,30],[0,12,21,29],[0,12,21,31],[0,12,22,30],[0,12,22,31],[0,12,25,30],[0,12,25,31],[0,13,20,30],[0,13,21,30],[0,17,20,30],[0,17,21,30],[0,18,21,30],[1,12,21,29],[1,12,21,30],[2,12,21,30],[2,12,21,31],[2,12,22,30],[2,12,22,31],[2,12,25,30],[2,12,25,31],[3,12,21,29],[3,12,21,30],[4,12,20,30],[4,12,21,29],[4,12,21,3